      "content": "i hear you but i really just cant afford to take time off work or pay for a specialist right now. i'm thinking of just taking a few extra ibuprofen and maybe doing some intense core stretches tonight to see if i can loosen it up. if i just focus on the stretching and getting the tension out of there, won't that eventually fix the nerve issue by itself? it seems way more practical than a hospital visit.",
